<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: designation beam -->
  <DMSE_Bullet_LaserDesignator.label>標定光束</DMSE_Bullet_LaserDesignator.label>
  
  <!-- EN: laser target designator -->
  <DMSE_Gun_LaserDesignator.label>雷射目標標定器</DMSE_Gun_LaserDesignator.label>
  <!-- EN: A handheld laser designator. Painting a spot on the ground or a target leaves a laser designation there for a couple of hours; laser-guided missiles fired by your colony lock onto the most recent designation on the target map. It deals no damage. -->
  <DMSE_Gun_LaserDesignator.description>手持式雷射標定器。照射地面或目標後，該處會留下約兩個小時的雷射引導點；你的殖民地發射的雷射制導導彈會鎖定目標地圖上最近一次標定的引導點。不造成傷害。</DMSE_Gun_LaserDesignator.description>
  <!-- EN: grip -->
  <DMSE_Gun_LaserDesignator.tools.grip.label>握把</DMSE_Gun_LaserDesignator.tools.grip.label>
  <!-- EN: designate -->
  <DMSE_Gun_LaserDesignator.verbs.designate.label>標定</DMSE_Gun_LaserDesignator.verbs.designate.label>
  
  <!-- EN: laser designation -->
  <DMSE_LaserDesignatorMark.label>雷射引導點</DMSE_LaserDesignatorMark.label>
  <!-- EN: A target point painted by a laser designator. Laser-guided missiles fired by the same faction home on the most recent designation on the target map. It cannot be damaged and fades on its own after a while. -->
  <DMSE_LaserDesignatorMark.description>以雷射標定器照射出的目標點。同陣營發射的雷射制導導彈會鎖定目標地圖上最近一次標定的引導點。無法被破壞，一段時間後自動消失。</DMSE_LaserDesignatorMark.description>
  
</LanguageData>